{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_16_level_main_16-13_beg",
  "groupId": "main_16",
  "stageId": "main_16-12",
  "title": "不曾遗忘",
  "storyCode": "16-13",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_16-13_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "532e997a4a9594abe32fbcf5a3d810a56ad6000b27696c5f835db76b31106df1",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "它是不是......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "不动了？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "text": "好像......是的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "text": "吼声，还有那种粗重的呼吸声都消失了，是我们的攻击对它起作用了吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "text": "可它还站着，没有倒下——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "text": "你们先不要动！我过去看看。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Mon3tr确认两人所在的位置安全后，独自向前走去。\n数秒前还形容癫狂的裂兽，此时已经被削去了部分体表的源石。它异常安静地站立着，就连奇怪的前肢也垂下，凝滞在身前。\nMon3tr小心翼翼地朝它靠近。\n她观察着这只裂兽，原本危险的野兽，躯体上发生的畸变使它看上去诡异万分。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "text": "是因为源石的影响，身体在急速向“人类”的方向转变......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "text": "一定很痛苦吧......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Mon3tr，小心！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "它又动了！",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "text": "呃——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "但预想中的攻击并未发生。裂兽没有移动，而是沉重地、毫无征兆地向前倒下——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "直到它的四肢重新接触大地。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......Mon3tr，我认为我们应该趁这个机会离开。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "离开这里，回研究所。就现在。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "text": "不，博士。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Mon3tr？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "text": "它背上甚至还有起伏，它还在呼吸！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "text": "而且它听上去......很痛苦？我不知道。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "text": "我没有阿米娅那种感受他人情绪的能力，更何况它还只是一只变异的动物，但......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "text": "我知道就算不管它，把它留在这里，它也会死。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "text": "源石已经刺穿它的喉咙，它全身没有一处不痛，想把自己已经变异的器官都抓出来却没有能力。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "text": "或许这也是之前它为什么会攻击我们。它没办法控制自己。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "那就结束它的痛苦吧。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "text": "对。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "text": "不，没错。我能做到。我能......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "text": "结束它的痛苦。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "她继续走向倒下的野兽，停在它的近侧，用爪子紧紧贴住一块少有结晶的皮毛。\nMon3tr望着裂兽，打量它的身体，眼底只有异样的平静。\n然后，她以做微创手术般精准利落的动作，掐灭了变异裂兽最后的、断续的喘息。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "text": "......我们走吧，博士。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "text": "回研究所。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Mantra保持着聆听。\n她深知自己视野中的景象已不再可信，无论它是遭到了有意的扭曲，还是意外地反映了真实。\n于是她听着，直到人群之中，最后一句祷词如同第一片雪花落下。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "圣愚......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "“迦弗里伊尔”。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "那就停下。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "停止——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "这一切！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "于是Mantra不再尝试沟通。她向前一步，试图将那颤动着的红、白、黑色线条稳定下来。\n然而就在她伸手的瞬间——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "......！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "忽近忽远的声音",
          "text": "——Mantra——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Raidian",
          "text": "Mantra！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "......什么？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Raidian",
          "text": "你刚才一动不动。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Raidian",
          "text": "我从没见过你这样......你怎么了？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "你们没有听见？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Raidian",
          "text": "听见什么？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "年长的女人没有立刻回答。\n她环视四周，发现留下的矿工姿态并不像先前那样如出一辙。这发现令她皱起眉头，又看向自己身旁。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "阿洛伊泽在哪儿？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Raidian",
          "text": "她听了我的话，跑出去了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "所以，至少你刚才确实有叫我们离开。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Raidian",
          "text": "是，但我一点也不记得我为什么要喊你们离开......这太奇怪了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "精神类源石技艺。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Raidian",
          "text": "你确定吗？我们专门为此训练过，如果受到这类攻击，我不会毫无防备。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "Raidian，检查自己的短期记忆是否遭到了干扰。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Raidian",
          "text": "哪种干扰？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "我能造成的干扰。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "有次我让Mechanist忘了去找你是要借用“小树”和“小轴”的事，本质上不是抹除了那段记忆，而是阻断了记忆的形成。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Raidian",
          "text": "我记得......那是你第一次尝试像这样使用自己的源石技艺？大脑内的信息没有被成功储存就会造成记忆缺失，也就是遗忘。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "没错，来自你的提议。在对人体电信号的了解和利用上，你远比我更有经验。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Raidian",
          "text": "你觉得这里有人能跟你使用一样的源石技艺？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "无法确定，也可能我只是比你们看到、听到了更多。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Raidian",
          "text": "怎么说？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "Raidian，乌萨斯的圣愚可能在这里。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Raidian",
          "text": "圣愚？为什么突然提起——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Raidian",
          "text": "圣愚在这里？可乌萨斯仅存的圣愚，两年前就已经在圣骏堡被烧死了，这么短的时间之内，有可能诞生另一个圣愚吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "我不知道。这是我接下来要去确认的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Raidian",
          "text": "如果真是圣愚，如果它隐藏在队伍里，一路上我却什么都没发现......那就太危险了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Raidian",
          "text": "我会让其他人保持警戒，你也注意安全。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "这危险不是物理上的，至少暂时不是。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "如果需要，我会及时求助。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Raidian",
          "text": "别忘了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Mantra转身，迈向数秒前那红色曾经存在的位置。\n路上，不断有拥挤着靠在一起的矿工为她让出路来，或向她伸出手去。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "别乔克",
          "text": "女士，您想找......谁？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "别乔克",
          "text": "我们还会，离开，去圣骏堡，是不是？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "别乔克",
          "text": "我们会，活、活下去......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "（点头）",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "别乔克",
          "text": "可他们，好像，不想离开？我也问了，毕扬叔叔。他不想离开。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "别乔克",
          "text": "他宁愿，让创口，烂掉，也......不愿再、再逃了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "别乔克",
          "text": "可是，活着......难道不比，其他所有事，都重要吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "别乔克",
          "text": "您，不说话......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "疲倦的矿工",
          "text": "陌生人。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "疲倦的矿工",
          "text": "你要去见娜迦，是不是？那你该膝行过去，仰着头瞧她。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "疲倦的矿工",
          "text": "看着她，忏悔，然后得到宽恕。很快你就会发现从前不断挣扎、始终无法得到平静的自己，简直算得上是愚蠢。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Mantra不置可否。她没有使用源石技艺与这些人对话，只是颔首，而后目不转睛地盯着房间深处，与他们错身。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "疲倦的矿工",
          "text": "你会明白的......等到她跟前，你就会明白的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "屋内尽头，在其他人眼中佝偻而渺小的灰白身影正静静坐着，仿佛一尊塑像。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
          "text": "——圣愚？！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
          "text": "这不可能。绝不可能！圣愚已经死了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
          "text": "当初陛下出于仁慈，在定罪前允许那个疯子为自己的罪行进行辩护。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
          "text": "结果整整七天！整整七天他滴水未进，只为一刻不停地发表诡辩，拖延时间。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
          "text": "当时他甚至还胆敢站在帝国议会的中央，对每一个走进来旁听的人说——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
          "text": "“我原谅你”！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
          "text": "最后陛下忍无可忍，亲自宣判了他的死刑，但仍有被他蛊惑的信众去劫法场，进而爆发了近十年来发生在圣骏堡城区内最大的一场骚乱。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Raidian",
          "text": "你说的这些事我们都知道。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Raidian",
          "text": "问题在于，如果Mantra说那是圣愚，一定是因为对方露出了可供揣摩的痕迹。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Raidian",
          "text": "我们要做的只是保护好自己，然后等待她的消息。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Mantra并未像先前矿工说的那样俯下身去。\n她踏进背光的阴影里，直视前方，仿佛眼前是一双回望的眼瞳。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "我知道，你能“听见”。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "希望你不是只会模仿我的源石技艺和说话方式，圣愚。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "娜迦",
          "text": "“圣愚”......如果你需要我是这个名字。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "请解释这句话的含义。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "娜迦",
          "text": "迦弗里伊尔、索洛米达、贝斯梅特、阿芙罗拉、娜迦......又或者，“圣愚”。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "娜迦",
          "text": "所有这些，我是。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "......告诉我，你为什么要混入这些受苦的人当中？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "娜迦",
          "text": "因为，这是一场布道。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "娜迦",
          "text": "我将行遍这片广袤的土地，为了赎去人们遭受的苦。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "娜迦",
          "text": "也因为，我看见了她，听见了她。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "娜迦",
          "text": "我为她的痛苦所挽留，也因此驻足。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "“她”是谁？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "娜迦",
          "text": "一个受苦的灵魂。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "你诱骗她，让她称你为“娜迦”？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "娜迦",
          "text": "我从未诱骗。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "谎言。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "娜迦",
          "text": "她像你一样提问，我像我一般回答。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "娜迦",
          "text": "仅此而已。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "没有意义的回答。你究竟是什么？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "娜迦",
          "text": "你也看到我。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "我看到无序的虚影。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "娜迦",
          "text": "是的，我是。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "但在其他人眼中，你不是。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "解释。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "娜迦",
          "text": "世人看到的我的模样，只反映了他们对我的认知和期待。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "娜迦",
          "text": "我以为，在所有灵魂当中，只有你会理解我为何如此存在。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "娜迦",
          "text": "毕竟......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "娜迦",
          "text": "你是那个未完成的塑像，你曾会成为——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "娜迦",
          "text": "“我”。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Mantra紧紧盯住眼前诡异的虚影，却不确定自己能否从那上面看出任何有助于自己判断的信息。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "娜迦",
          "text": "很久以前，你曾剥除过一块黑色的腐肉。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "娜迦",
          "text": "我也一样。它追赶我，我驱逐它，像在呼吸之间从身上割下一块腐肉。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "荒谬的比喻。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "娜迦",
          "text": "不。这只是简单的道理。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "娜迦",
          "text": "如果它已经腐烂，不再与你身体的其他部分同气连枝......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "娜迦",
          "text": "那又为何还要保留？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "......这是......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "你的记忆？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "但也是我——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "不。内卫......你能影响内卫，你当然也能影响那些矿工。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "娜迦",
          "text": "你杀死它。你成为我。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "如果这是我们之间唯一共通的地方，那么......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "“身体”“腐肉”。你与内卫的关系——圣愚是内卫实验的源头。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "从颤动着的虚影之中，不再有声音传来。既不辩驳，也不肯定。\nMantra开始后退，离开了阴影的边缘。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "......Raidian，我需要支援。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Raidian",
          "text": "我在。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "已确认先前的推测。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "另外，补充信息......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "圣愚隐藏在矿工之中，帮助他们杀死了内卫。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Raidian",
          "text": "......我明白了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Raidian",
          "text": "你需要我们怎么做？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "我需要你继续想办法联络罗德岛在乌萨斯其他地区的支援队伍，同时请阿米娅拖住阿洛伊泽。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "我们现在不能马上离开这里，至少在我找到能唤醒矿工们的办法之前不行。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "让极境留在我的源石技艺使用范围之内，我可能会需要他的帮助。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Raidian",
          "text": "你想做什么？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "解除圣愚施加在矿工们身上的影响。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Raidian",
          "text": "你认为是圣愚控制了这些矿工，让他们拒绝离开？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "没错。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "我们无法直接杀死圣愚，但它却随时可以杀死这里的每一个人。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Raidian",
          "text": "......也许阿米娅能帮忙。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "也许可以，但阿米娅并不了解圣愚。我不希望她一无所知地卷入其中。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "圣愚与我的能力多有相似，这也是为什么只有我能做出这样的判断。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "它依靠他人的认知建立自身，我需要找到使它建立起“娜迦”这个身份的关键，然后才能解除圣愚施加的影响。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Raidian",
          "text": "你有怀疑的对象了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "......没错。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Mantra将视线投向四周的矿工，最后落到正从自己身旁经过，走向圣愚的女孩身上。\n她茫然地呢喃着，惶惑而悲伤。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "text": "我只是需要时间确认。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
